{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"more_loop\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_loops\": [\n    \"S03→S04：S03想告诉对方自己的喜欢、确认对方是否也一样，却没能开口；S04又回到想说却怕给对方负担、最后留话不说。属于重复出现，但S04明确记起上次，表达愿望更强，仍有一定推进。\",\n    \"S08→S09→S11→S13：反复在盼望两个人长久亲近与担心对方将来不再需要自己之间摆动。S09用眼前的亲近安慰自己，S11发展出即使不被需要也愿意陪伴的态度，S13又出现自我保护、想收回一点喜欢的念头，焦虑有新的层次。\",\n    \"S01→S04→S13：早期怕表达太多会给对方造成负担、想藏起喜欢的心理再次出现。不过S13的动机已经转为害怕将来失去亲近、想减少自己的受伤，S14又明确回望最初的自己，形成前后对照。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_loops\": [\n    \"S03→S04：想表达喜欢、想确认对方心意，却犹豫着没有说出口；下一段再次出现同样的愿望与顾虑，虽然愿望有所增强，但仍是一次回摆。\",\n    \"S08→S09→S11→S13→S14：对未来能否长久、对方是否还会需要自己反复担忧。S09暂时用眼前的亲近安慰自己，S11又因未来不可控而心痛，S13转而寻求永远不变的承诺，紧接着又怀疑即使得到承诺也不能保证未来，S14再次回到未来未必长久的感伤。\",\n    \"S01→S04→S05→S13：怕自己太需要对方、怕显得太黏、想把喜欢藏起来的心理反复出现。S13虽然把动机转成避免将来受伤，但仍然回到减少表达、收起喜欢的旧办法。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"两条前12段完全相同，都有对亲近、表达、失去之间的反复摇摆。关键区别在结尾：X的S14回望最初的自己，明确意识到一路以来的变化，并选择不再隐藏喜欢；Y的S13先怀疑承诺能否保证未来，S14又重复未来可能不长久的担忧，虽然最后也选择不后悔地喜欢，却在未来焦虑上多绕了一圈，因此Y更像在迷宫里来回。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5a75026d-c84f-414c-8668-5c4bd694c91b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T080108144412Z", "elapsed_seconds": 38.609, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T08:01:46.768747+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2d1d774e58dd282cdbd99a2b4eb69c407a6c841e04862239cc76550f6437bbbc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T080108144412Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "1bfba04c093f5a89eedf50f0e90ed27915b8cbd512270aa67369db8557154094"}}}
